{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>United Streamlands</strong> has to fight the terrible\u00a0<strong>Frowners</strong> once again,\u00a0who already occupied and exploited their lands in the past. As <strong>Chief Colonel Pavelson</strong> of the 4th Division &quot;Black&quot;,\u00a0you will suddenly find yourself having to defend the independence of your <strong>Country</strong>. <br> <br><strong>Streamlands: Defense</strong> is a Tower Defense with accurate resource management, essential for positioning troops and unlocking upgrades. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465180/extras/screen_gameplay01_english.png?t=1742226930\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the story in <strong>5 unique Scenarios</strong> with all different mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br>  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465180/extras/screen_scenarios_english.png?t=1742226930\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Read the <strong>documents</strong> to learn about the <strong>history</strong> of this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465180/extras/screen_documents_english.png?t=1742226930\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Streamlander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3465180/528eada76dbb7691448af6dbbf31af52df856a50.jpg"},{"name":"Frowners Return","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3465180/fbef32abf010048263e55f17281ee02a835f5b68.jpg"},{"name":"Unexpected Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3465180/b250696afdece819e5a13cac5fc93504ebe922bd.jpg"},{"name":"The Secret Plan","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3465